ched when                                                           | Level     |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------- |\n| In the Trash | each item in your Trash; deleting it is the same as emptying the Trash | <Level of=\"safe\" /> |","table":"table-5"},"325":{"id":"/docs/what-it-finds-53","page_id":"/docs/what-it-finds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/what-it-finds#trash-and-old-downloads","content":"| What         | Matched when                                                    | Level     |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- | --------- |\n| Old download | each item in `~/Downloads` not changed for 90 days (adjustable) | <Level of=\"personal\" /> |","table":"table-5"},"326":{"id":"/docs/what-it-finds-54","page_id":"/docs/what-it-finds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/what-it-finds#large-files","content":"Files of 500 MB or more (adjustable) that no rule above covers, outside apps and photo libraries. <Level of=\"personal\" />"},"327":{"id":"/docs/what-it-finds-55","page_id":"/docs/what-it-finds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/what-it-finds#docker","content":"From Docker's own disk-usage report, when an engine is running. See Docker and OrbStack."},"328":{"id":"/docs/what-it-finds-56","page_id":"/docs/what-it-finds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/what-it-finds#system-junk","content":"Most of these belong to root, so deleting them needs the helper. Items macOS protects are skipped even then."},"329":{"id":"/docs/what-it-finds-57","page_id":"/docs/what-it-finds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/what-it-finds#system-junk","content":"| What         | Location                         | Level     |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| System cache | each folder in `/Library/Caches` | <Level of=\"safe\" /> |","table":"table-6"},"330":{"id":"/docs/what-it-finds-58","page_id":"/docs/what-it-finds","tags":